OL,3,GNEWSABiogas plant uses food waste to
OL,4,Aheat 7,000 homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FA facility that turns food waste into
OL,7,Fgas that can heat up to 7,000 homes has
OL,8,Fopened in Dorset.
OL,10,FThe biogas plant in Parley can handle
OL,11,Fmore than 50,000 tonnes of food waste a
OL,12,Fyear from Bournemouth, Christchurch and
OL,13,FPoole.
OL,15,FThe #20m facility, which employs six
OL,16,Ffull-time operators, creates
OL,17,Fbiomethane, which is fed directly into
OL,18,Fthe gas network.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
